{"seq":3,"slug":"promise-audit-compliance-governance","title":"承诺审计、对客一致性与合规治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-audit-compliance-governance","wordCount":3067,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺审计-对客一致性与合规治理\">承诺审计、对客一致性与合规治理</h1><p>一笔订单承诺违约后，法务问的第一个问题不是「为什么迟了」，而是「你们当时到底承诺了什么、依据什么算出来的」。答案不在数据库的当前状态里——库存早已变动、产能排程早已重算、当时的政策版本早已被覆盖。引擎每天生成数百万条承诺，任何一条都可能在交期争议、拒付（chargeback）、退货纠纷或财务审计中被回溯质询。本文处理<strong>可审计性</strong>与<strong>一致性治理</strong>：如何留下可重放的证据链、如何保证引擎口径与买家所见不漂移、以及各辖区交付承诺硬约束如何反推引擎默认行为。参见 <a href=\"../atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺日期计算模型</a>、<a href=\"../inventory-supply-availability/net-available-quantity-computation\">净可承诺量计算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺审计的三条证据要求\">核心概念：承诺审计的三条证据要求</h2><p>承诺审计（promise audit）与普通日志审计的区别在于它必须回答一个<strong>反事实问题</strong>：「在当时的输入与政策下，引擎是否应当给出这个日期？」要能回答它，每条承诺记录必须固化的不是结果，而是<strong>可重放的计算前提</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入快照</td>\n<td>各节点净可用量、在途、已占用产能、承运商额度</td>\n<td>无法证明当时库存足够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策版本</td>\n<td>分配优先级策略、时长分位数（P50/P90）、黑名单节点、节假日日历版本</td>\n<td>无法区分「算错」与「按旧版策略算对」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎指纹</td>\n<td>求解器版本、模型参数、代码提交哈希、随机种子</td>\n<td>无法复现同日同单的不同结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些证据构成一个<strong>重放包</strong>（replay bundle）。审计时把重放包喂回引擎的确定性模式，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>Replay</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>bundle</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{D} = \\text{Replay}(\\text{bundle})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Replay</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bundle</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与原始承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{committed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比对，相等才证明引擎行为自洽。这里有个易踩的坑：重放要求求解器在<strong>固定随机种子</strong>且<strong>输入完全冻结</strong>下确定，而实时引擎为吞吐常用近似算法、并行归约或浮点累加顺序不定，重放结果会有毫秒到小时级抖动。工程解法不是要求浮点一致，而是把承诺<strong>桶化</strong>到日粒度后比对——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 天内的差异视为等价，超阈值的进入人工调查队列。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[订单询价到达] --&gt; B[冻结输入快照&lt;br/&gt;库存/在途/产能/额度]&#10;    B --&gt; C[记录政策版本与引擎指纹]&#10;    C --&gt; D[求解并产出承诺日期 D_committed]&#10;    D --&gt; E[写入承诺事件流&lt;br/&gt;含重放包引用]&#10;    E --&gt; F[同步到对客触点&lt;br/&gt;PDP/结算/确认页/跟踪页]&#10;    F --&gt; G{后续审计触发?}&#10;    G --&gt;|拒付/投诉/财务抽查| H[取出重放包]&#10;    H --&gt; I[确定性重放 Replay]&#10;    I --&gt;|与 D_committed 桶化一致| J[举证成立]&#10;    I --&gt;|超出容差| K[进入异常调查&lt;br/&gt;并标记引擎缺陷]\">graph TD\n    A[订单询价到达] --&gt; B[冻结输入快照&lt;br/&gt;库存/在途/产能/额度]\n    B --&gt; C[记录政策版本与引擎指纹]\n    C --&gt; D[求解并产出承诺日期 D_committed]\n    D --&gt; E[写入承诺事件流&lt;br/&gt;含重放包引用]\n    E --&gt; F[同步到对客触点&lt;br/&gt;PDP/结算/确认页/跟踪页]\n    F --&gt; G{后续审计触发?}\n    G --&gt;|拒付/投诉/财务抽查| H[取出重放包]\n    H --&gt; I[确定性重放 Replay]\n    I --&gt;|与 D_committed 桶化一致| J[举证成立]\n    I --&gt;|超出容差| K[进入异常调查&lt;br/&gt;并标记引擎缺陷]</pre><h2 id=\"对客一致性-从引擎口径到买家可见表述\">对客一致性：从引擎口径到买家可见表述</h2><p>「对客一致性」（customer-facing consistency）指同一笔订单在<strong>所有触点上呈现同一个语义</strong>。跨境链路触点至少六处，任一处的口径偏移都会变成投诉与拒付的种子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触点</th>\n<th>常见表述</th>\n<th>漂移风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品详情页（PDP）</td>\n<td>「预计 3–5 个工作日送达」</td>\n<td>用静态 SLA 而非实时 CTP 结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算页</td>\n<td>「预计到货 3 月 14 日」</td>\n<td>未含清关时长，比引擎承诺早 2 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认邮件</td>\n<td>「将于 48 小时内发出」</td>\n<td>发货承诺与到货承诺混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商跟踪页</td>\n<td>「预计派送 3 月 16 日」</td>\n<td>承运商自有模型，与引擎承诺不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售后工单系统</td>\n<td>客服看到的交期</td>\n<td>缓存旧值，落后一个政策版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销素材</td>\n<td>「限时 7 日达」</td>\n<td>文案承诺未纳入引擎约束集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>漂移有两类根因。<strong>口径漂移</strong>是同一事实的多种表述：PDP 说「3–5 个工作日」、结算页说「3 月 14 日」，物理上等价但买家无法换算，争议时卖家举证劣势。<strong>版本漂移</strong>是同一次承诺的多个快照：引擎在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 承诺 3 月 14 日，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因运力变化改到 3 月 17 日，确认邮件已发出而跟踪页仍读旧值。设计上应把「承诺」建成<strong>带版本的不可变对象</strong>：所有触点只读同一对象的当前版本，任何变更走显式的承诺更新事件并向买家发送通知——这正是欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 18 条与英国《消费者合同条例》2013 第 42 条的要求落点。</p>\n<p>一致性可用一个可监控的量刻画。设订单集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>shown</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{shown}}(o,c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shown</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为触点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 展示的交期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{committed}}(o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为引擎承诺：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DriftRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>shown</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DriftRate} = \\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\,o \\in O \\;:\\; \\exists c,\\; D_{\\text{shown}}(o,c) \\neq D_{\\text{committed}}(o)\\,\\}\\bigr|}{|O|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DriftRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shown</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个指标应分触点、分市场、分承运商下钻。漂移率最高的源通常是承运商跟踪页——它由第三方生成，卖家只能通过回传引擎承诺值并要求承运商优先采信来压制；做不到消歧时，应在跟踪页显式标注「卖家承诺交期」与「承运商预计派送」两个字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计证据链-不可变日志与承诺重放\">审计证据链：不可变日志与承诺重放</h2><p>证据链的核心要求是<strong>不可否认性</strong>（non-repudiation）：承诺记录一旦写入，任何主体——包括运维和 DBA——都不能在不留痕的情况下修改它。工程上用三层手段叠加。第一层是<strong>追加写事件流</strong>：承诺不以「当前值」存储，而以「已创建 / 已变更 / 已履行 / 已违约」的事件序列存储，当前状态由事件归约得出。第二层是<strong>哈希链</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_n = H(h_{n-1} \\| e_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：对历史事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的任何篡改都会使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 及其后全部摘要失效，校验只需比对末条摘要与外部锚点。第三层是 <strong>WORM 存储</strong>：审计日志落到一次写多次读的介质或对象锁策略上。</p>\n<p>保留期由监管与支付网络共同约束。PCI DSS v4.0.1 要求审计日志至少保留 12 个月，其中最近 3 个月须可立即检索；GDPR 第 5(1)(e) 条的存储限制原则又禁止超期保留可识别个人的数据——交叉意味着承诺日志必须做<strong>字段级分层</strong>：技术字段（承诺值、政策版本、求解指纹）长期保留，买家身份字段到期脱敏，脱敏本身也记录为审计事件。拒付举证尤其依赖它：Visa 原因码 13.1 与 Mastercard 原因码 4853（均为「未收到商品或服务」）通常要求商户在约 120 天内提交发货与送达证明，此时要拿得出的是<strong>该笔订单当年的承诺值与送达凭证</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规基线-交付承诺的硬约束反推引擎默认行为\">合规基线：交付承诺的硬约束反推引擎默认行为</h2><p>监管对「承诺」的最直接约束是<strong>默认交付期限</strong>。美国联邦贸易委员会《邮购、网购与电话订购商品规则》（16 CFR Part 435，即&quot;30 天规则&quot;）规定：卖家未明确承诺发货时间时，须在收货后 30 天内发货；若无法按期发货，必须通知买家并提供取消订单退款或接受延期两个选项——<strong>不得默示延期</strong>。欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 18(1) 条给出同量级默认值：除另有约定外，经营者应不迟于合同订立后 30 天交付；英国脱欧后由《消费者合同条例》2013 第 42 条承接口径。这直接约束引擎行为：CTP 不可行时不能静默返回最早就绪日，必须取得买家明示同意延期或允许退款。</p>\n<p>这组规则对引擎有一个直接的设计推论：<strong>当实时 CTP 求解不可行时，引擎不能默认返回「最早就绪日」并静默延长交期</strong>。合规的默认行为是三分支——返回可行交期、返回不可行并要求买家显式同意延期、或拒绝下单。任何「先收单再慢慢调到可行」的实现都落在 30 天规则的违规区。跨境场景还要叠加市场准入与自动化决策规则：DSA 第 30 条要求在线市场对卖家身份做可追溯登记，GDPR 第 22 条对产生重大影响的纯自动化决策给出告知与救济要求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>辖区 / 体系</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>对承诺引擎的约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>FTC 16 CFR Part 435</td>\n<td>未承诺即 30 天发货；延期须买家同意或退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>指令 2011/83/EU 第 18 条</td>\n<td>默认 30 天交付；远程销售另有 14 天撤回权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>消费者合同条例 2013 第 42 条</td>\n<td>与欧盟同口径的 30 天默认期限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟市场平台</td>\n<td>DSA (EU) 2022/2065 第 30 条</td>\n<td>卖家身份可追溯，承诺责任方须可识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付网络</td>\n<td>Visa 13.1 / Mastercard 4853</td>\n<td>约 120 天内须提交承诺与送达证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保护</td>\n<td>GDPR 第 5、15、22 条</td>\n<td>存储限制、访问权、自动化决策告知与救济</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计日志</td>\n<td>PCI DSS v4.0.1 要求 10</td>\n<td>留存 12 个月，近 3 个月可即时检索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一致性指标-异常处置与财务口径联动\">一致性指标、异常处置与财务口径联动</h2><p>对客一致性和合规性最终要落到一组可被运营和财务共同读懂的指标上。承诺准确率（Promise Accuracy, PA）衡量承诺是否被兑现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PA</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>DIFOT</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>足量</mtext><mo>∧</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PA} = \\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\,o : t^{\\text{actual}}_o \\le D_{\\text{committed}}(o)\\,\\}\\bigr|}{|O|}, \\qquad \\text{DIFOT} = \\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\,o : \\text{足量} \\wedge t^{\\text{actual}}_o \\le D_{\\text{committed}}(o)\\,\\}\\bigr|}{|O|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style