an></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DIFOT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">足量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>DIFOT（Delivered In Full On Time）比 PA 更严，因为它同时要求「足量」与「准时」。平台侧门槛是硬性的：Amazon 对自配送卖家的准时送达率（OTDR）与迟到发货率（LSR）设有明确阈值——SFP 计划历史上要求 OTDR ≥ 97%、LSR &lt; 4%、预售取消率 &lt; 2.5%、订单缺陷率 &lt; 1%，低于阈值会直接失去流量与资格。承诺准确率因此不是软目标，而是带惩罚曲线的运营红线。</p>\n<p>异常处置需要一个分诊矩阵，把「引擎缺陷」与「履约异常」分开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重放与承诺值桶化后不一致</td>\n<td>引擎缺陷（非确定性）</td>\n<td>冻结该策略版本，回归测试后重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重放一致但实际未达</td>\n<td>履约异常（外部）</td>\n<td>归因承运商/清关，承诺保守化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触点交期与引擎承诺不等</td>\n<td>一致性缺陷</td>\n<td>修触点读取路径，补发变更通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺变更未通知买家</td>\n<td>合规缺陷</td>\n<td>补通知并开放取消/退款选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单市场拒付率异常上升</td>\n<td>口径风险</td>\n<td>复核该市场时长分位数与默认口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条联动常被忽略：<strong>承诺日期是收入确认的输入</strong>。在 ASC 606 / IFRS 15 框架下，控制权转移时点决定收入确认期间，承诺交期与实际交付日的偏离会直接影响期末在途订单的收入归属，进而进入财务审计的抽样范围。承诺审计日志因此也是<strong>财务控制测试</strong>的证据来源——审计师会抽样订单，要求复现「这一单为何被承诺在 Q3 交付、收入确认为何落在 Q3」。支撑不了复现，问题就从工程缺陷升级为内控缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺审计的举证对象是<strong>可重放的计算前提</strong>（输入快照、政策版本、引擎指纹），重放按日粒度桶化容差比对，避免浮点抖动制造假警报。</li>\n<li>对客一致性要拆成<strong>口径漂移</strong>与<strong>版本漂移</strong>分别治理；承诺应是带版本的不可变对象，所有触点读同一版本，变更走显式事件并对买家通知。</li>\n<li>不可否认性靠追加写事件流 + 哈希链 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_n = H(h_{n-1}\\|e_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> + WORM 存储三层叠加；保留期由 PCI DSS v4.0.1 的 12 个月与 GDPR 存储限制原则共同定界，需做字段级分层。</li>\n<li>FTC 16 CFR 435 与 EU 2011/83/EU 第 18 条的 30 天默认期限约束引擎默认行为：不可行时静默延长交期是违规的，延期须取得买家同意或退款。</li>\n<li>承诺准确率是带惩罚曲线的运营红线（OTDR/LSR/ODR 阈值），且承诺日期同时是 ASC 606 / IFRS 15 下收入确认的输入，承诺日志因此也是财务内控测试的证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺审计、对客一致性与合规治理","id":"承诺审计-对客一致性与合规治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺审计的三条证据要求","id":"核心概念-承诺审计的三条证据要求"},{"level":2,"text":"对客一致性：从引擎口径到买家可见表述","id":"对客一致性-从引擎口径到买家可见表述"},{"level":2,"text":"审计证据链：不可变日志与承诺重放","id":"审计证据链-不可变日志与承诺重放"},{"level":2,"text":"合规基线：交付承诺的硬约束反推引擎默认行为","id":"合规基线-交付承诺的硬约束反推引擎默认行为"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性指标、异常处置与财务口径联动","id":"一致性指标-异常处置与财务口径联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承诺异常与重承诺：缺货、延迟与改址触发的重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-exception-replanning"},"next":null}